flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Login{User Login}
    Login -->|Patient| PMenu[Patient Dashboard]
    Login -->|Doctor| DMenu[Doctor Dashboard]
    Login -->|Receptionist| RMenu[Reception Desk]
    Login -->|Admin| AMenu[Admin Dashboard]

    PMenu --> PAction{Patient Action}
    PAction -->|Register/Profile| PReg[Update Profile & Medical History]
    PAction -->|Browse| PBrowse[Search Doctors by Specialty/Clinic]
    PAction -->|Book| PBook[Select Slot & Payment Method]
    PBook --> PConfirm[Confirm Appointment]
    PAction -->|View| PView[View Appointments & Prescriptions]
    PAction -->|Cancel| PCancel[Cancel Appointment]

    DMenu --> DAction{Doctor Action}
    DAction -->|Schedule| DAvail[Set Available Time Slots]
    DAction -->|Consult| DConsult[View Patient & Medical History]
    DConsult --> DPresc[Add Medication & Dosage]
    DPresc --> DComplete[Mark Appointment Complete]

    RMenu --> RAction{Receptionist Action}
    RAction -->|Check In| RCheckIn[Check In Patient]
    RAction -->|Status| RStatus[Update Status: In Progress / Finished]
    RAction -->|Payment| RPay[Process Cash or Visa Payment]

    AMenu --> AAction{Admin Action}
    AAction -->|Doctors| ARegDoc[Register Doctor Account]
    ARegDoc --> AAssign[Assign Clinics to Doctors]
    AAction -->|Analytics| AStats[View System Statistics]
    AAction -->|Users| ADelete[Delete User Profile]

    PConfirm --> End([End])
    DComplete --> End
    RPay --> End
    AStats --> End
    PCancel --> End
